  "text": "\n     Election Help Needed! • Windham, NH \n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Living In... \r\n\t\t\t Explore \r\nHome \n                News Flash\nElection Help Needed! \nNews Flash \n            Election Help Needed!\n                Home\n                Posted on October 07, 2026 \nELECTION HELP NEEDED! \n The Windham Town Clerk’s office is seeking individuals to serve as Ballot Clerks at the November 3, 2026 State General Election.  \nTo qualify, you must be a registered voter in Windham. Training will be provided.  \nYou may choose to donate your time or receive compensation of $15/hour.  \nIf you are interested, please e-mail townclerk@windhamnh.gov or call 603-434-5075 for more information. \nRelated News \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSelf-guided Cemetery Tour\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on October 01, 2026 \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAmerica's 250th\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosted on January 06, 2026 \n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Building Permits \r\n\t\t\t Tax Assessments \r\n\t\t\t GIS Map & Property Info \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Windham \r\n3 North Lowell Road \r\nWindham, NH 03087 \r\n(603) 965-1201 \r\nOld Values, New Horizons \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Accessibility \n         Privacy Policy \n         Copyright Notices \n         Sign In \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
